{"id": "86305", "name": "מד\"ר מדויקת – ערך הפרמטר k שעבורו המשוואה מדויקת (ב) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>For what values of k is the following differential equation exact?</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ ( {{CT:0}} ) \\frac{dy}{dx} + {{CT:1}} = 0.\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( k = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> write the equation as \\(A\\,y'+B=0\\) and require \\(\\partial A/\\partial x=\\partial B/\\partial y\\); this is an equation in \\(k\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The coefficients</b><br>As the differential equation<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ ( {{CT:0}} ) \\frac{d y}{dx} + {{CT:1}} = 0 \\]</p>is of the form<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A(x,y)\\frac{dy}{dx} + B(x,y) = 0 \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The exactness condition</b><br>the condition for the differential equation to be exact is<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{\\partial A}{\\partial x} = \\frac{\\partial B}{\\partial y} \\]</p>Therefore<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}}={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Solving for k</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ k={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Mk", "Nk", "P1", "PO", "Pk", "correctanswer", "diffMk", "diffNk", "nk"], "nvariants": 50}